@alexsnsk 
I had to also come up wit a workaround to "merge" instance-admin-password & jwt-signature-secret into the airbyte-auth-secrets secret but I don't trust the stability of my solution either because it relies on specific actions to be taken in a specific order and I am not sure if any restart or reinstall would break this. 

A great solution would be to be able to provide a different secret name for the custom set password so it doesn't interfere with airbyte managed airbyte-auth-secrets data keys at all.
